Description: Machine learning application for selection of covariate effects
    using Lasso pre-screening, the Boruta algorithm with tree-based learners
    (LightGBM, random forest, XGBoost, or CatBoost), and fold-wise voting.
    CatBoost support is optional: the 'catboost' package is not on CRAN
    (install from GitHub release binaries; see
    https://catboost.ai/en/docs/installation/r-installation).
